 W1s remain unshown vs 4 W3s\n- Keeps maximum flexibility with B8 and F4 pungs\n\nReason: W1 is a terminal tile with the least utility in my current hand. With most Character tiles already gone from the game, keeping W1 pair offers minimal value. Discarding W1 maintains my strongest elements: the B8 triple, F4 triple, and keeps F3 pair for potential pung. This keeps my hand flexible for All Pungs (6 points) or Half Flush (6 points) patterns while maintaining pair options.\n\nAnswer: Play W1"}
